# BrainOS — Changelog

## [5.0.0] — 2026-04-12

### Critical Bug Fixes (were causing blank screen / JS failure)
- **FIXED** Fatal syntax error `const url = ;` in `bayesForceUpdate()` at line 3131 — killed entire script block
